ew-MPI1105-Opaque-Series-Film.png", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto R8 Avery Dennison New MPI1105 Opaque Series Film", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Subaru-Dyanamic-Colors-Film-Effects.png", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto Subaru Dyanamic Colors Film Effects", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Bugatti-Avery-Dennison-Conform-Chrome-Series-Wrapping-Film.jpeg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto Bugatti Avery Dennison Conform Chrome Series Wrapping Film", "tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2020/02/Golf-GTI-Avery-Dennison-Fresh-Spring-Gloss-SW900-252-S.jpeg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto Golf GTI Avery Dennison Fresh Spring Gloss SW900-252-S", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Exotic Car Wrap Colours</h4> <p>Are you looking to change up your car, bike, or recreational equipment for spring and summer? Look at some of the amazing colour options Avery Dennison has brought out in the last few months. Now is the time to visit us to miss the spring rush. We can apply all these Avery Dennison vinyl Exotic Car Wrap colour options to your car or motorcycle. We also have many vinyl options that we can apply to recreational crafts, from light aircraft to boats and jet skis.<br/>Vinyl Wrap Toronto has been using Avery Dennison vinyl to wrap everything from personal cars to golf carts and commercial fleet vehicles. Our installation crew has more than 12 years of experience with wrapping vehicles. Our design team can take your ideas, dreams, and wishes and put them on your vehicle.</p> <p>Vinyl Wrap Toronto understands that whether you drive a Bugatti or a Golf, you love your vehicle. Avery Dennison Vinyl wrap is rated to last between 5 and 7 years even for Exotic Car Wraps. Speak 